{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>Her prophets are reckless</b> — empty, like פחז כמים (Gen. 49:4). They have no bread to eat, therefore they prophesied." "<b>And the word בוגדות</b> — acts, and they are masculine for feminine בוגדות." "<b>They have done violence</b> — evil done openly is called חמס. They corrupted the law of justice and did not judge according to the law, and they wrongfully took money."], :book :zephaniah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 3, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Zephaniah -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/zfanya"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:47:24.338624412Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}